{"body":"## Bug Report\n\nTiDB can \"decorrelate\" a correlated subquery today, but cannot correlate a subquery that was originally non-correlated.\n\n### 1. Minimal reproduce step (Required)\n\n<!-- a step by step guide for reproducing the bug. -->\n\n```\ncreate table t1 (a int, b int, key(a));\ncreate table t2 (a int, b int, key(a));\n\nexplain select * from t1 where b = 1 and a in (select t2.a from t2, t1 where t1.a = t2.a);\n```\n\n### 2. What did you expect to see? (Required)\n\n```\n+-----------------------------------+----------+-----------+----------------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| id                                | estRows  | task      | access object        | operator info                                                                                                    |\n+-----------------------------------+----------+-----------+----------------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Apply_81                          | 9.99     | root      |                      | CARTESIAN semi join, left side:TableReader_84                                                                    |\n| ├─TableReader_84(Build)           | 9.99     | root      |                      | data:Selection_83                                                                                                |\n| │ └─Selection_83                  | 9.99     | cop[tikv] |                      | eq(test.t1.b, 1), not(isnull(test.t1.a))                                                                         |\n| │   └─TableFullScan_82            | 10000.00 | cop[tikv] | table:t1             | keep order:false, stats:pseudo                                                                                   |\n| └─Limit_91(Probe)                 | 9.99     | root      |                      | offset:0, count:1                                                                                                |\n|   └─IndexHashJoin_100             | 9.99     | root      |                      | inner join, inner:IndexReader_120, outer key:test.t2.a, inner key:test.t1.a, equal cond:eq(test.t2.a, test.t1.a) |\n|     ├─IndexReader_117(Build)      | 8.91     | root      |                      | index:Selection_116                                                                                              |\n|     │ └─Selection_116             | 8.91     | cop[tikv] |                      | eq(test.t2.a, test.t1.a)                                                                                         |\n|     │   └─IndexFullScan_115       | 8910.08  | cop[tikv] | table:t2, index:a(a) | keep order:false, stats:pseudo                                                                                   |\n|     └─IndexReader_120(Probe)      | 11.14    | root      |                      | index:Selection_119                                                                                              |\n|       └─Selection_119             | 11.14    | cop[tikv] |                      | eq(test.t1.a, test.t1.a), not(isnull(test.t1.a))                                                                 |\n|         └─IndexRangeScan_118      | 11148.75 | cop[tikv] | table:t1, index:a(a) | range: decided by [eq(test.t1.a, test.t2.a)], keep order:false, stats:pseudo                                     |\n+-----------------------------------+----------+-----------+----------------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```\n\n### 3. What did you see instead (Required)\n\n```\n+---------------------------------+----------+-----------+----------------------+----------------------------------------------------------+\n| id                              | estRows  | task      | access object        | operator info                                            |\n+---------------------------------+----------+-----------+----------------------+----------------------------------------------------------+\n| HashJoin_33                     | 9.99     | root      |                      | inner join, equal:[eq(test.t1.a, test.t2.a)]             |\n| ├─TableReader_57(Build)         | 9.99     | root      |                      | data:Selection_56                                        |\n| │ └─Selection_56                | 9.99     | cop[tikv] |                      | eq(test.t1.b, 1), not(isnull(test.t1.a))                 |\n| │   └─TableFullScan_55          | 10000.00 | cop[tikv] | table:t1             | keep order:false, stats:pseudo                           |\n| └─HashAgg_69(Probe)             | 7992.00  | root      |                      | group by:test.t2.a, funcs:firstrow(test.t2.a)->test.t2.a |\n|   └─MergeJoin_76                | 12487.50 | root      |                      | inner join, left key:test.t2.a, right key:test.t1.a      |\n|     ├─IndexReader_51(Build)     | 9990.00  | root      |                      | index:IndexFullScan_50                                   |\n|     │ └─IndexFullScan_50        | 9990.00  | cop[tikv] | table:t1, index:a(a) | keep order:true, stats:pseudo                            |\n|     └─IndexReader_49(Probe)     | 9990.00  | root      |                      | index:IndexFullScan_48                                   |\n|       └─IndexFullScan_48        | 9990.00  | cop[tikv] | table:t2, index:a(a) | keep order:true, stats:pseudo                            |\n+---------------------------------+----------+-----------+----------------------+----------------------------------------------------------+\n```\n\n### 4. What is your TiDB version? (Required)\n\nCurrent/master (TiDB X & 8.5.5)\n\n","comments":[],"number":66320,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Planner: correlate a non-correlated IN subquery","url":"https://github.com/pingcap/tidb/issues/66320"}
